  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-06T17:58:10.820Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As of the 3.7.6 World SDK release, we now have separate build & test vs build & reload actions. The problem is in \"Build & Reload\", the clients value is still selectable and editable with no visual change, even though it doesn't actually launch a client.\n\nThis behaviour is unintuitive - the clients should probably be greyed out or hidden under \"Build & Reload\". This should also apply to all other UI elements in that area aside from \"Platform(s)\", as none are relevant when you are only doing build & reload.\n\nI vote for greying them out personally, but hiding might make more sense.",
